meta {
  name: Get All Driver - Vehicle Relation
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/driver/vehicle
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Driver - Vehicle Relation

  This request is used to get all driver with his assigned vehicle. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes, and a pagination.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Driver fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by driver relation's `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "driver fetched",
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "username": "jhondoe",
          "fullname": "Jhon Doe",
          "email": "jhondoe@gmail.com",
          "phone": "08123456780",
          "telegram_user_id": "123456789",
          "telegram_is_valid": 1,
          "vehicle_list": "D 1610 ZBC - Brio RS MT, D 4110 ADC - Toyota Innova"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — driver failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "driver not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}